#Saudi Traffic in the Jazan region, in coordination with 
@SaudiDCD
, apprehends - in real-time - a vehicle driver for committing a violation of crossing wadis and ravines while they are flowing, and the regulatory measures were applied against him.

His Royal Highness Minister of Foreign Affairs Prince #Faisal_bin_Farhan 
@FaisalbinFarhan
 receives a phone call from His Excellency Minister of Foreign Affairs, International Cooperation, and Egyptians Abroad in the Arab Republic of Egypt, Dr. Badr Abdelatty.

Dr Abdulla Hamad AlGhfeli, Acting Director General of 
@ad_mobility
, and Bayat AlQubaisi, Deputy Manager of Blue Gulf Group, have discussed the second field trial of an autonomous patrol boat and its role in advancing Abu Dhabi’s smart maritime mobility ecosystem.
